    "q-96003": {
      "dom_id": "step-q96003",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "$\\int (5\\operatorname{csch}⁡y\\operatorname{coth}⁡y+3\\operatorname{cosh}⁡y)\\text{d}y=$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(\\operatorname{sinh}⁡y)=\\operatorname{cosh}⁡y & \\,⇒\\,\\int \\operatorname{cosh}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y=\\operatorname{sinh}⁡y+C, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(\\operatorname{csch}⁡y)=-\\operatorname{csch}⁡y\\operatorname{coth}⁡y & \\,⇒\\,\\int \\operatorname{csch}⁡y\\operatorname{coth}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y=-\\operatorname{csch}⁡y+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (5\\operatorname{csch}⁡y\\operatorname{coth}⁡y+3\\operatorname{cosh}⁡y)\\text{d}y & =\\int 5\\operatorname{csch}⁡y\\operatorname{coth}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y+\\int 3\\operatorname{cosh}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =5\\int \\operatorname{csch}⁡y\\operatorname{coth}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y+3\\int \\operatorname{cosh}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =5(-\\operatorname{csch}⁡y)+3\\operatorname{sinh}⁡y+C \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{sinh}⁡y-5\\operatorname{csch}⁡y+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-96003-a",
