    "q-96016": {
      "dom_id": "step-q96016",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "$\\int (4-3{sech}^{2}⁡\\theta )\\,\\text{d}\\theta =$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}\\theta }(\\operatorname{tanh}⁡\\theta )={sech}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,⇒\\,\\int {sech}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta =\\operatorname{tanh}⁡\\theta +C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (4-3{sech}^{2}⁡\\theta )\\,\\text{d}\\theta  & =\\int 4\\,\\text{d}\\theta +\\int (-3{sech}^{2}⁡\\theta )\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =4\\int \\,\\text{d}\\theta -3\\int {sech}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =4\\theta -3\\operatorname{tanh}⁡\\theta +C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
